# 2) Subsequent never arms: counter keyed by BrowsingContext::Id() reset on Fission /
#    cross-group nav. Now BrowserId (tab-stable) in C++ + chrome Map.
#
# Rebuild: allow-subdir docshell/base + toolkit/library + browser/components + install-dist_bin
#

